=== POST /auth/signup (username already taken)
--- status: 500
--- body:
"username already exists"

=== POST /auth/signup (body is not valid JSON)
--- status: 400
--- body:
"unexpected EOF"

=== POST /auth/login (wrong password)
--- status: 401
--- body:
"crypto/bcrypt: hashedPassword is not the hash of the given password"

=== POST /auth/login (no such user)
--- status: 401
--- body:
"user not found"

